# LICENSE, NOTICE and LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY are DELIBERATELY not ignored: the
# final stage copies them into the image. They were excluded here, which meant
# an image shipped a statically linked binary carrying every dependency's code
# and none of their licence files, and it would now fail the build instead.
